045","text":"May act at junctions between the membrane and the cytoskeleton. Possesses tyrosine phosphatase activity."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}